{"id":"pata","lemma":"pata","pos":"noun","rank":3393,"glosses":["paw, foot, leg (of an animal)","human leg, foot, footprint (often used by an angry person)"],"ipa":"/ˈpa.tɐ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"patas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/93/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-pata.wav","examples":[{"text":"Um cão tem quatro patas.","en":"A dog has four legs.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"dog"},{"g":"has / there is","l":"ter"},{"g":"four"},null]},{"text":"Tire suas patas de mim.","en":"Get your paws off me.","words":[{"g":"to take","l":"tirar"},{"g":"his","l":"seu"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"me"}]},{"text":"As aranhas têm oito patas.","en":"Spiders have eight legs.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"spider","l":"aranha"},{"g":"to own","l":"ter"},{"g":"eight"},null]},{"text":"O gato estava lambendo suas patas.","en":"The cat was licking its paws.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"cat"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to lick","l":"lamber"},{"g":"his","l":"seu"},null]},{"text":"Um gato tem uma cauda e quatro patas.","en":"A cat has a tail and four legs.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"cat"},{"g":"has / there is","l":"ter"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},{"g":"tail"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"four"},null]}]}